{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31164","headline":"申湖 · 薛能","name":"申湖","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"昔年依峡寺，每日见申湖。\n下泪重来此，知心一已无。\n雨霖舟色暗，岸拔木形枯。\n旧境深相恼，新春宛不殊。\n方来寻熟侣，起去恨惊凫。\n忍事花何笑，喧吟瀑正麤。\n堪忧从宦到，倍遣曩怀孤。\n上马终回首，傍人怪感吁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛能","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31164.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31164","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}